### Listar vehículos
GET http://localhost:3000/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Crear vehículo
POST http://localhost:3000/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Sprinter",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2022,
  "capacidad_carga": 1500.50
}